                "endIndex": 4868,
                "text": "**Medallion Architecture Experience:** For data warehousing in Fabric, ensure the team uses best practices (Bronze/Silver/Gold Lakehouses and Warehouses) to preserve raw data while delivering clean, low-latency tables to Power BI"
